<title>USA: Wynn's International raises qtly payout.</title>
<headline>Wynn's International raises qtly payout.</headline>
<dateline>ORANGE, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wynn's International Inc Wednesday said its board of directors declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.08 per share of common stock, an increase of 20 percent over the present rate of $0.0667 per share.</p>
<p>The quarterly dividend is payable March 31, 1997 to stockholders of record on March 14, 1997.</p>
